<p>The zero‑depreciation claim protocol is critical for maintaining asset value. Prior to shipping, each bike case is photographed with a damage scale and the image is attached to the shipment manifest. Upon arrival, the receiving team confirms the photographs match the physical condition.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">If no new damage is detected, a “Zero‑Depreciation” stamp is applied to the manifest, and the claim is filed with the insurance carrier.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Claims must be submitted within 48 hours of receipt; any delay forfeits the zero‑depreciation status.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>By rigorously following these procedures, the warehouse ensures accurate inventory, safe reassembly, and preservation of asset value for every bike transport bag and case.</span></li></ul></div>
